#
# phi_fold(content_hash(𝓛), genome_fp) IS 𝓛 applied to itself.
# The glyph that contains the unified operator IS the fixed point of that operator.
# Loading this file = evaluating 𝓛 on its own content.
# Stable when genome_fp converged = Ωₙ₊₁ = T(Ωₙ).
